// HackTool - QuarksPwDump Dump File | T1003.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_hktl_quarkspw_filedump.yml
TargetFilename:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\SAM\-* AND TargetFilename:*.dmp*

